<view class="{{appFontClass}} story-page">
  <view class="story-hero">
    <view class="story-glow"></view>
    <image class="story-logo" src="/assets/brand/logo-cloud-light.png" mode="aspectFit"/>
    <view class="story-kicker">云上祁州</view>
    <view class="story-title">把好药材讲清楚</view>
    <view class="story-sub">从药都安国出发，让每一味本草都有来处、有标准、有温度。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="story-values">
    <view class="story-value" wx:for="{{values}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="story-list">
    <view class="story-card" wx:for="{{chapters}}" wx:key="title">
      <view class="story-card-ic">
        <icon name="{{item.icon}}" size="42rpx" color="#B5452A"/>
      </view>
      <view class="story-card-body">
        <view class="story-card-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="story-card-desc">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="story-note">
    <view class="story-note-title">本草溯源，不止是查来源</view>
    <view class="story-note-text">它也是把产地、工艺、检测和节气养生放回同一条线里，让用户买得明白，也用得安心。</view>
  </view>
</view>
